   "default": "What did she like about him? Her friends wanted to know. She raised her tea to her lips as she paused to think, then smiled, feeling rather sheepish. How could she choose any one thing and not list them all? She hardly knew him, of course\u2014tonight was only the third date. But there was such familiarity between them, as if they\u2019d known each other a lifetime ago and were simply catching up."
